---
---
<section class="founders" id="team">
  <div class="container founders-inner">
    <div class="founders-text">
      <span class="section-label" data-i18n="founders.label">who's behind diamo?</span>
      <h2 class="founders-headline" data-i18n="founders.headline">A SMALL TEAM.<br/>A BIG IDEA.</h2>
      <p class="founders-body" data-i18n="founders.body">We're building the kind of health and movement experience we wish already existed.<br/><br/>Personalized. Science-aware. Built for real life.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="founders-visual">
      <div class="founders-editorial">
        <img src="/images/kyb-community-girls.jpg" alt="diamo team energy" class="founders-img" />
        <div class="founders-img-overlay"></div>
        <div class="founders-img-text">
          <span class="founders-img-line">LIVE LONG.</span>
          <span class="founders-img-line founders-img-line--italic">CAUSE TROUBLE.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .founders {
    background: #fff;
    padding: 7rem 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .founders-inner {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 6rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .founders-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .founders-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy, #0C2A6E);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .founders-body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(12,42,110,0.55);
    max-width: 400px;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Editorial visual */
  .founders-visual {
    position: relative;
  }

  .founders-editorial {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
    box-shadow: 0 24px 72px rgba(12,42,110,0.12);
  }

  .founders-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    display: block;
    filter: saturate(0.85);
  }

  .founders-img-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      rgba(12,42,110,0.0) 40%,
      rgba(12,42,110,0.75) 100%
    );
  }

  .founders-img-text {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1.75rem;
    left: 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.1em;
  }

  .founders-img-line {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  }

  .founders-img-line--italic {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ice-blue, #C8DEF5);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .founders { padding: 5rem 1.5rem; }
    .founders-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
    }
    .founders-editorial {
      aspect-ratio: 4/3;
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .founders-img-line { font-size: 1.25rem; }
  }
</style>
